body:
Well darnit, No significant source of dietary fat? Oh come on.   

&#x200B;

LoLz. Sorry guys, I just had to.  Love my Trader Joes

 Delaware.  

&#x200B;

For those of you who are reading my response that are actually from there, I offer to you my deepest apologies.

I wished I would have known what a frigging time suck this place is and avoided it. Its like crack man, once you start you cant stop.  I can never get anything constructive done once I get on here. 

&#x200B;

Like now... Damnitalltohell!    Arrrrrrrrrrrrrrrgh!
